      "section_path": "Part I Item 1 > Manageability",
      "section_label": "Part I Item 1",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Manageability",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "For example, with the NetApp Copy and Sync service, customers can migrate data to the cloud securely and efficiently.",
