      "section_label": "Part I Item 1",
      "category": null,
      "subheading": "Manageability",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "The NetApp Backup and Recovery service delivers seamless and cost-effective backup and restore capabilities for protecting and archiving cloud and on-premises data managed by ONTAP.",
