      "subheading": "Manageability",
      "role": "body",
      "text": "The NetApp Classification service provides data discovery, mapping, and classification driven by AI algorithms with automated controls and reporting for data privacy regulations such as the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), and more.",
